      "section_code": "thesis",
      "section_title": "Sector Synthesis & Thesis",
      "content": "The Large Capital Goods Sector in India is undergoing a powerful multi-year structural expansion driven by a twin engine:\nGovernment-led energy grid & railway capex alongside private industrial capacity additions\n(metals, cement, data centers, electronics).\nWith sector order books standing at an all-time high of\n\u20b91.85 Lakh Cr\n(~3.4x revenue coverage), companies with high technology intensity (ABB, Siemens, Cummins) are commanding premium pricing power and expanding margins above historical averages.",
      "source_locator": "capital-goods-large-q1fy27-sector-review.html#.synth"
    }
  ],
